<main class="sw-overview">
  <section class="sw-dashboard-head" aria-labelledby="overview-title">
    <div><p class="sw-eyebrow">SWARM / <%= @network_name %></p><h1 id="overview-title">Network overview<span>.</span></h1><p class="sw-dashboard-lead">Blocks, transactions and the state of the chain.</p></div>
    <form action="/search" class="sw-search sw-dashboard-search" role="search">
      <label for="hero-search" class="sr-only">Search a block height, block hash, transaction id or address</label>
      <span class="sw-search-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="hero-search" name="qs" type="search" required placeholder="Block, transaction or address" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"/>
      <kbd aria-hidden="true">/</kbd><button type="submit" class="sw-btn">Search ↗</button>
    </form>
  </section>
  <%= unless ZcashExplorer.Swarm.mainnet?() do %><p class="sw-test-note"><%= @network_name %> &middot; TEST COINS, NO VALUE</p><% end %>
  <section aria-labelledby="network-title" class="sw-network-section">
    <div class="sw-section-heading"><div><h2 id="network-title">Network snapshot</h2></div><span class="sw-caption">Node readings · updated automatically</span></div>
    <div class="sw-metrics-grid">
      <%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.BlockCountLive) %>
      <%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.DifficultyLive) %>
      <%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.NetworkSolpsLive) %>
      <%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.SupplyLive) %>
      <%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.MempoolInfoLive) %>
      <%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.PeersLive) %>
      <%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.HalvingLive) %>
      <%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.BlockChainSizeLive) %>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sw-history-section" aria-label="Recent block activity"><%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.BlockActivityLive) %></section>
  <section aria-labelledby="activity-title">
    <div class="sw-section-heading"><div><h2 id="activity-title">Latest activity</h2></div><a href="/blocks" class="sw-text-link">Browse all blocks →</a></div>
    <div class="sw-activity-grid"><%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.RecentBlocksLive) %><%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.RecentTransactionsLive) %></div>
  </section>
  <section class="sw-pool-section" aria-label="Shielded value pools"><%= live_render(@conn, ZcashExplorerWeb.ShieldedPoolLive) %></section>
  <section class="sw-explainer" aria-label="Reading the explorer">
    <div><span class="sw-pill sw-pill-shielded">SHIELDED</span><h3>Privacy has a clear boundary.</h3><p>Blocks and transaction IDs are public. Shielded transfers hide their sender, receiver and amount; the explorer cannot reveal them.</p></div>
    <div><span class="sw-pill sw-pill-revealed">REVEALED</span><h3>Only public data is shown.</h3><p>Transparent inputs and outputs are visible on chain. A displayed public output total is not necessarily the full value of a mixed or shielded transfer.</p></div>
    <div><span class="sw-pill sw-pill-neutral">NODE VIEW</span><h3>One window into the network.</h3><p>Peers and pending transactions describe this node. Zero pending transactions means an empty mempool. Missing readings are marked unavailable.</p></div>
  </section>
</main>
